        (
            name: "create-asset-model",
            aliases: [],
            description: Some("Creates an asset model from specified property and hierarchy definitions. You create assets from asset models. With asset models, you can easily create assets of the same type that have standardized definitions. Each asset created from a model inherits the asset model\'s property and hierarchy definitions. For more information, see Defining asset models in the IoT SiteWise User Guide. You can create two types of asset models, ASSET_MODEL or COMPONENT_MODEL.    ASSET_MODEL – (default) An asset model that you can use to create assets. Can\'t be included as a component in another asset model.    COMPONENT_MODEL – A reusable component that you can include in the composite models of other asset models. You can\'t create assets directly from this type of asset model"),
